    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9717" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντεράω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>love in return,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀντερώντων ίμέρῳ πεπληγμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					544
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρῶν ἀντερᾶται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					8.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Bion
				<u>Fr.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντερᾶν τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMar.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντερᾶσθαι ὑπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dio</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rival in love,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.972d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινί τινος</span>
			<i>rival</i> one <i>in love for . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				184
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀντερᾶν</span>”
				<i>jealous love,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
